CHECK name=qhat_band_rejects_a_perturbation_at_a_derived_rung verdict=PASS rung=20 factor=1+2^-20 relative_factor_ratio_to_licensed=8.241 measured_mean_rel_ratio=7.863,7.682 rejected=2/2 unperturbed_accepted=2/2 note=the rung comes from the band's own licensed mean_rel and nothing else, and the UNPERTURBED row must still pass the same comparator, so a predicate that rejects everything cannot pass this. The measured ratio sits a little under 8 because the perturbation partly cancels the error that is already there — a real property of a signed difference, printed rather than hidden (witness: qhat_perturbation_fires_on_a_probe_consistent_inflation)
CHECK name=qhat_reduction_alternatives_both_licensed verdict=PASS pairwise_f32_tree_inside=True wide_f64_accumulator_inside=True ascending_f32_pre_fix_inside=False tree_vs_wide64_differing_words=17368 note=the shipped form and llama.cpp's wide-accumulator shape are both inside the population AND the licence at the SAME max_abs, which is what lets the device budget (fp64 is derated on gfx1151; AGENTS.md §GOAL's >= 48 t/s bar) pick the tree without touching the licence; the pre-fix ascending row is inside NEITHER, which is the second direction this predicate needs to have teeth (witness: sumsq_control_is_outside_the_probe_population)
